            <ArticleTitle>Evidence-based practice in action.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>313-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>As Associate Editor for Journal of Pediatric Nursing (JPN), I will be assisting with evidence-based practice (EBP) submissions or other clinically based articles. I welcome questions, works-in-progress for constructive criticism, and finished submissions for review. This article comprises an overview of the EBP process, an EBP submission format for JPN, and 4 examples of EBP in a variety of pediatric clinical settings.</AbstractText>
